.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504665/purdue-faa-ground-stop-bus-iowa","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman of Week 11: Duke's Nate Sheppard has entered the running","description":"In a season in which star running backs seem to be popping up out of nowhere, the Blue Devils' sophomore stands out.","published":"2026-11-17T11:35:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503621/heisman-watch-week-11-duke-nate-sheppard","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on College Football Playoff bubble ahead of committee's third ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-17T11:24:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503628/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-third-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Breaking down the major futures for the Big Ten, from the Heisman to the CFP","description":"Let's evaluate whether a standout performance on a three-loss team and a 10-0 team are real or a mirage in the Big Ten.","published":"2026-11-17T13:02:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50504671/college-football-heisman-trophy-cfp-futures-betting-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Arkansas State tells Butch Jones he's out at end of year","description":"Arkansas State has informed football coach Butch Jones that he's out at the end of the season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Monday night.","published":"2026-11-17T02:45:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50506952/sources-butch-jones-arkansas-state-coach","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T23:15:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Illinois may turn to third-string QB Boyd after Houser injury","description":"Illinois might turn to third-string quarterback Carson Boyd this week against No. 15 Iowa after starter Katin Houser suffered a broken nose Friday at UCLA that required surgery.","published":"2026-11-16T21:42:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504718/illinois-turn-third-string-qb-boyd-houser-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Rivers says NC State only college job he would have taken","description":"New coach Philip Rivers said NC State was the only college job he would have taken.","published":"2026-11-17T12:34:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504530/rivers-says-nc-state-only-college-job-taken","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest up to No. 10 in AP poll as top teams avoid upsets","description":"Wake Forest's move up to No. 10 was the only week-over-week change atop the AP poll as the top nine teams remained unchanged.","published":"2026-11-16T20:48:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504044/wake-forest-no-10-ap-poll-top-teams-avoid-upsets","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas' Manning to participate in senior day, mum on future","description":"Texas quarterback Arch Manning said Monday he will participate in Saturday's senior day ceremonies despite having one year of eligibility remaining.","published":"2026-11-16T20:31:37.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503997/texas-arch-manning-participate-senior-day","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4702828/aj-holmes-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A._J._Holmes_Jr."},"pick":{"pick":49,"round":2,"team":"LAR","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"A. J. Holmes Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A._J._Holmes_Jr.","description":"American football player (born 2003)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:27Z","intro":"Anthony \"A. J.\" Holmes Jr. (born November 7, 2003) is an American college football defensive tackle for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Houston Cougars.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Holmes Jr. attended Westfield High School in Houston, Texas. As a senior season, he was named the District 14-6A MVP. Coming out of high school, Holmes Jr. committed to play college football for the Houston Cougars over other offers from schools such as TCU, Kansas State, Washington State, SMU, and Virginia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"HOUSTON\nDuring his freshman season in 2022, Holmes Jr. notched six tackles with half a tackle being for a loss. In the 2023 season, he appeared in 12 games with three starts, where he totaled 21 tackles with four and a half going for a loss, and two and a half sacks. During the 2024 season, Holmes Jr. tallied 40 tackles with eight and a half being for a loss, and two sacks. After the season, he entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS TECH\nHolmes Jr. transferred to play for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. In week 2 of the 2025 season, he notched four tackles with two being for a loss, a sack, a pass deflection, and a fumble recovery in a blowout win over Kent State. In week 6, Holmes Jr. recorded two sacks in a win versus Kansas. In week 7, he recorded a sack against Arizona State. For his performance during the 2025 season, Holmes Jr. was named a first-team All-American by Pro Football Focus."}]}}